{#
================================================================================
目录页 (Table of Contents)
文件: m_toc.jinja2
版本: v1.1 (B方案: 两次渲染动态页码)
描述: 列出报告各大部分标题和页码, 帮助用户快速定位内容
位置: M0(封面) + 概览 → [本页] → M1(一、诊断摘要)
不编序号 — 与封面、概览、附录同级, 属报告"框架页"
关联CSS: m_toc.css

页码注入:
  pdf_service.py 两次渲染: 第一次生成临时PDF → fitz提取页码 →
  JS注入到 data-toc-key 对应的 span → 第二次生成最终PDF
================================================================================
#}

{# toc_pages: 由渲染器注入 (Jinja2层), 格式 {"m1": 4, "m4": 6, ...} #}
{% set _pages = toc_pages | default({}) %}
{% set _pv_toc = page_visibility | default({}, true) %}
{% set _comp_toc = composition_deep | default({}, true) %}
{% set _rd_toc = reading_deep | default({}, true) %}
{% set _has_english_deep_toc = (_pv_toc.m10_composition | default(false) and _comp_toc.enabled | default(false)) or (_pv_toc.m11_reading_deep | default(false) and _rd_toc.enabled | default(false)) %}

<div class="mtoc-page{% if _has_english_deep_toc %} mtoc-page--extended{% endif %}">

  {# --- 标题 --- #}
  <div class="mtoc-title-section">
    <h1 class="mtoc-title">目 录</h1>
  </div>

  {# --- 目录列表 --- #}
  <ul class="mtoc-list">

    <li class="mtoc-item">
      <span class="mtoc-item__number">一</span>
      <span class="mtoc-item__title">诊断摘要</span>
      <span class="mtoc-item__dots"></span>
      <span class="mtoc-item__page" data-toc-key="m1">{{ _pages.get('m1', '') }}</span>
    </li>

    <li class="mtoc-item">
      <span class="mtoc-item__number">二</span>
      <span class="mtoc-item__title">六大领域达标分析</span>
      <span class="mtoc-item__dots"></span>
      <span class="mtoc-item__page" data-toc-key="m4">{{ _pages.get('m4', '') }}</span>
    </li>

    <li class="mtoc-item">
      <span class="mtoc-item__number">三</span>
      <span class="mtoc-item__title">核心短板清单</span>
      <span class="mtoc-item__dots"></span>
      <span class="mtoc-item__page" data-toc-key="m2">{{ _pages.get('m2', '') }}</span>
    </li>

    <li class="mtoc-item">
      <span class="mtoc-item__number">四</span>
      <span class="mtoc-item__title">知识点短板钻取</span>
      <span class="mtoc-item__dots"></span>
      <span class="mtoc-item__page" data-toc-key="m3">{{ _pages.get('m3', '') }}</span>
    </li>

    <li class="mtoc-item">
      <span class="mtoc-item__number">五</span>
      <span class="mtoc-item__title">城市考情对照</span>
      <span class="mtoc-item__dots"></span>
      <span class="mtoc-item__page" data-toc-key="m5">{{ _pages.get('m5', '') }}</span>
    </li>

    <li class="mtoc-item">
      <span class="mtoc-item__number">六</span>
      <span class="mtoc-item__title">分层与学习建议</span>
      <span class="mtoc-item__dots"></span>
      <span class="mtoc-item__page" data-toc-key="m6">{{ _pages.get('m6', '') }}</span>
    </li>

    {% set _qd_toc = question_detail | default({}, true) %}
    {% set _qd_papers_toc = _qd_toc.papers | default([], true) %}
    {% if _qd_papers_toc | length > 0 and _qd_toc.total_count | default(0) > 0 %}
    <li class="mtoc-item">
      <span class="mtoc-item__number">七</span>
      <span class="mtoc-item__title">逐题分析明细</span>
      <span class="mtoc-item__dots"></span>
      <span class="mtoc-item__page" data-toc-key="m9">{{ _pages.get('m9', '') }}</span>
    </li>
    {% endif %}

    <li class="mtoc-item">
      <span class="mtoc-item__number">{% if _qd_papers_toc | length > 0 and _qd_toc.total_count | default(0) > 0 %}八{% else %}七{% endif %}</span>
      <span class="mtoc-item__title">数据覆盖与可信度说明</span>
      <span class="mtoc-item__dots"></span>
      <span class="mtoc-item__page" data-toc-key="m7">{{ _pages.get('m7', '') }}</span>
    </li>

    <li class="mtoc-item mtoc-item--framepage">
      <span class="mtoc-item__number"></span>
      <span class="mtoc-item__title">附录</span>
      <span class="mtoc-item__dots"></span>
      <span class="mtoc-item__page" data-toc-key="m8">{{ _pages.get('m8', '') }}</span>
    </li>

    {% if _pv_toc.m10_composition | default(false) and _comp_toc.enabled | default(false) %}
    <li class="mtoc-item">
      <span class="mtoc-item__number">十</span>
      <span class="mtoc-item__title">作文精讲</span>
      <span class="mtoc-item__dots"></span>
      <span class="mtoc-item__page" data-toc-key="m10">{{ _pages.get('m10', '') }}</span>
    </li>
    {% endif %}

    {% if _pv_toc.m11_reading_deep | default(false) and _rd_toc.enabled | default(false) %}
    <li class="mtoc-item">
      <span class="mtoc-item__number">十一</span>
      <span class="mtoc-item__title">阅读精讲</span>
      <span class="mtoc-item__dots"></span>
      <span class="mtoc-item__page" data-toc-key="m11">{{ _pages.get('m11', '') }}</span>
    </li>
    {% endif %}

  </ul>

  {# --- 阅读建议 --- #}
  <div class="mtoc-reading-guide">
    <div class="mtoc-reading-guide__title">阅读建议</div>
    <div class="mtoc-reading-guide__items">
      <div class="mtoc-reading-guide__item">
        <span class="mtoc-reading-guide__num">1</span>
        <span>先看<strong>诊断摘要</strong>了解整体水平，再看<strong>六大领域达标分析</strong>定位薄弱方向。</span>
      </div>
      <div class="mtoc-reading-guide__item">
        <span class="mtoc-reading-guide__num">2</span>
        <span>重点关注<strong>核心短板清单</strong>中的 P0 级知识点，这些是提分最快的突破口。</span>
      </div>
      {% if _qd_papers_toc | length > 0 and _qd_toc.total_count | default(0) > 0 %}
      <div class="mtoc-reading-guide__item">
        <span class="mtoc-reading-guide__num">3</span>
        <span>对照<strong>逐题分析明细</strong>逐题回顾错题，理解薄弱环节的具体表现。</span>
      </div>
      {% endif %}
      {% if _has_english_deep_toc %}
      <div class="mtoc-reading-guide__item">
        <span class="mtoc-reading-guide__num">4</span>
        <span>英语专项页可直接查看<strong>作文精讲</strong>与<strong>阅读精讲</strong>，把错因转成下一周训练任务。</span>
      </div>
      {% endif %}
    </div>
  </div>

</div>
